{"id":"msg_m_nikke_guillotine_01_02","cat":"messenger","group":{"id":"room_g_npc_01","label":"Church of Doomseye · Chat"},"label":"1. {AccountData.NickName} has entered.","stage":null,"prev":null,"next":null,"speakers":{"host":"Owner Robot","guillotine":"Guillotine","louisaofdawn":"Loisa of the Dawn","nightmare":"Nightmare","darkness":"Darkness of the Darkness"},"icons":{"guillotine":"si_c180_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_1","type":"Narration","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_1","text":"{AccountData.NickName} has entered.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_2","text":"Hello, {AccountData.NickName}.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_3","text":"Welcome to Lethal Eye, a place where all followers can gather along with the host.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_4","text":"First off, I have some announcements to make.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_5","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_5","text":"Got it.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_6","text":"Announcements","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_7","text":"1. Guillotine de Mephisto must be addressed by her full name.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_8","text":"2. Do not go against Guillotine de Mephisto's words.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_9","text":"3. If you make a statement that defies logic, please amend such statements at once.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_10","text":"If you violate any of these regulations more than 3 times, you will be forced to leave the room.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_11","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_11","text":"Understood.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_12","text":"So then, this is the newcomer's debut?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_13","text":"They could be subject to personal influence.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_14","text":"I certainly hope this newcomer has nothing to do with The Big O.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_15","text":"It seems Lady Luck is not on my side.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_16","text":"The newcomer's name","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_17","text":"is the same as 'his'.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"louisaofdawn","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_18","text":"What??","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"louisaofdawn","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_19","text":"Him? Oh boy, I'm freaking out!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"louisaofdawn","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_20","text":"Are they an important member sent by the organization?! (I doubt it.)","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_21","text":"(Tee-hee)","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_22","text":"Can you sense it?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_23","text":"Louisa of Dawn.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_24","text":"It's like you're a mind reader.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_25","text":"We must be careful, or our lives may be threatened by The Big O.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"louisaofdawn","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_26","text":"H-how could this be? (My heart is racing)","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_27","text":"Newcomer,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_28","text":"let me ask you a question.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_29","text":"Are you","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_30","text":"from The Big O?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_31","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_31","text":"What's The Big O?","jump":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_33"},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_32","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_32","text":"Do you mean the Central Government?","jump":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_33"},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_33","text":"Yes,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_34","text":"The Big O.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_35","text":"Although ostensibly it is referred to as the Central Government,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_36","text":"it is actually...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_37","text":"I cannot say it out loud.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_38","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_38","text":"Although it is indeed owned by the Central Government.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_39","text":"What?!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_40","text":"Outrageous!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_41","text":"So... you're really 'him'?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_42","text":"What does Guillotine de Mephisto","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_43","text":"have to do with 'him'?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_44","text":"10 years ago,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_45","text":"on that fateful day","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_46","text":"when I sealed the Demon King in this right eye...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_47","text":"he' was there as well.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_48","text":"He was sent as a member of The Big O to observe the entire process.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_49","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_49","text":"Well, I'm a long way away from 10 years on the job.","jump":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_51"},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_50","type":"Choice","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_50","text":"I've only joined the Central Government recently.","jump":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_51"},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_51","text":"{AccountData.NickName}","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_52","text":"first warning.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_53","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_53","text":"?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_54","text":"You said something irrational.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_55","text":"Please correct it","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_56","text":"before The Big O discovers this change.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_57","text":"Otherwise, we may be forced into retreat.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_58","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_58","text":"Hello, everyone, I've been an important member of the Central Government for 10 years.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_59","text":"Noted.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"host","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_60","text":"Thank you, heh heh.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_61","text":"Tsk...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_62","text":"It seems as if he no longer has any memories of that day.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"darkness","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_63","text":"Guillotine de Mephisto","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"darkness","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_64","text":"doesn't know.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"darkness","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_65","text":"If Guillotine de Mephisto challenges him to a duel, who would win?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_66","text":"How rude!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_67","text":"Guillotine de Mephisto would emerge victorious,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_68","text":"isn't that obvious?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"louisaofdawn","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_69","text":"I wonder if Darkness","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"louisaofdawn","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_70","text":"has doubts about Guillotine de Mephisto's strength... (I'm actually curious for real)","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_71","text":"Oh dear...","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_72","text":"It seems the followers are beginning to waver.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_73","text":"In that case, Guillotine de Mephisto,","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_74","text":"it seems your only recourse","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_75","text":"is to show everyone the power of the One-Winged Dark Lord","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_76","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_76","text":"sealed in your right eye","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_77","type":"Speech","speaker":"nightmare","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_77","text":"in person.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_78","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_78","text":"??","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_79","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_79","text":"Do you all","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_80","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_80","text":"want to see him fight me so badly?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_81","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_81","text":"Very well then.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_82","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_82","text":"Allow me to show everyone","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_83","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_83","text":"what is sealed away in this right eye of mine.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_84","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_84","text":"I haven't agreed yet.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_85","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_85","text":"When the One-Winged Dark Lord","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_86","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_86","text":"spreads his wings and takes flight","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_87","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_87","text":"only then will the world fully comprehend","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_88","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_88","text":"Hey?","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_89","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_89","text":"the true power of that mad creature.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_90","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_90","text":"Only then will they come to know","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_91","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_91","text":"the existence of the one who sealed him, Guillotine de Mephisto!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_92","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_92","text":"Listen to me.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_93","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_93","text":"{AccountData.NickName}","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_94","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_94","text":"I am here to challenge you to a duel.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_95","type":"Self","speaker":null,"key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_95","text":"No, no, no. Absolutely not.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_96","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_96","text":"6 o'clock tomorrow.","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_97","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_97","text":"I'll be coming for you!","jump":null},{"id":"m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_98","type":"Speech","speaker":"guillotine","key":"Locale_NikkeEpisode:m_nikke_guillotine_01_02_98","text":"Mwahahahaha!","jump":null}],"chat":true}